# Manual Verification

### View password aging policy

```bash
grep "^PASS_" /etc/login.defs
```

---

### Display password aging for a user

```bash
sudo chage -l username
```

---

### Check password hashing configuration

```bash
grep ENCRYPT_METHOD /etc/login.defs
```

---

### View password status

```bash
sudo passwd -S username
```

---

### Check for PAM account lockout

```bash
grep faillock /etc/pam.d/* 2>/dev/null
```

---

